        391.42608642578125,
        104.98149871826172
      ],
      "text": "Routine HIV testing for people with presumptive and diagnosed TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        119.4703369140625,
        461.4620361328125,
        131.28733825683594
      ],
      "text": "22.\tHIV testing services should be offered to all individuals with presumptive and diagnosed TB  (strong",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        129.2097930908203,
        260.806396484375,
        140.83779907226562
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, low quality of evidence) (10).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        152.7430419921875,
        482.9425354003906,
        164.56004333496094
      ],
      "text": "23.\tAll household contacts of a person with HIV-associated TB should be offered HIV testing services  (strong",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        162.4824981689453,
        270.619384765625,
        174.11050415039062
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, very low-quality evidence) (19).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        186.0155029296875,
        510.6886291503906,
        197.83250427246094
      ],
      "text": "24.\tIn settings of high HIV burden, all household and close contacts of people with TB should be offered HIV testing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        195.72808837890625,
        330.978271484375,
        207.5450897216797
      ],
      "text": "services  (strong recommendation, very low-quality evidence) (19).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        219.2882080078125,
        512.6398315429688,
        231.10520935058594
      ],
      "text": "25.\tIn settings of low HIV burden, all household members and close contacts of people with TB who have symptoms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        229.000732421875,
        499.5964660644531,
        240.81773376464844
      ],
      "text": "compatible with TB disease may be offered HIV testing services as part of their clinical evaluation  (conditional",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        238.7401885986328,
        270.619384765625,
        250.36819458007812
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, very low-quality evidence) (19).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        262.2733154296875,
        509.27374267578125,
        274.0903015136719
      ],
      "text": "26.\tPartner services should be offered to people with HIV-associated TB  (strong recommendation, moderate-quality",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        272.0128479003906,
        142.16290283203125,
        283.6408386230469
      ],
      "text": "evidence) (23).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        307.04852294921875,
        278.0260925292969,
        320.238525390625
      ],
      "text": "HIV treatment and care for people with TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        334.7272033691406,
        510.33856201171875,
        346.544189453125
      ],
      "text": "27.\tA package of interventions including screening, treatment and/or prophylaxis for major opportunistic infections,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        344.4397277832031,
        521.9710083007812,
        356.2567138671875
      ],
      "text": "rapid ART initiation and intensified adherence support interventions should be offered to everyone presenting with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        354.1522216796875,
        389.157470703125,
        365.9692077636719
      ],
      "text": "advanced HIV disease  (strong recommendation, moderate-quality evidence) (24).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        377.7124328613281,
        522.3246459960938,
        389.5294189453125
      ],
      "text": "28.\tART should be started as soon as possible within two weeks of initiating TB treatment, regardless of CD4 cell count,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        387.4248046875,
        221.1492919921875,
        399.2417907714844
      ],
      "text": "among people living with HIV  (25). a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        397.1373291015625,
        413.2806396484375,
        408.9543151855469
      ],
      "text": "Adults and adolescents  (strong recommendation, low- to moderate-certainty evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        406.84991455078125,
        317.7777099609375,
        418.6669006347656
      ],
      "text": "Except when signs and symptoms of meningitis are present. a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        430.4100036621094,
        510.7461853027344,
        442.22698974609375
      ],
      "text": "29.\tAntiretroviral therapy is recommended for all patients with HIV and drug-resistant tuberculosis requiring second-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        440.1225280761719,
        508.0281066894531,
        451.93951416015625
      ],
      "text": "line antituberculosis drugs, irrespective of CD4 cell count, as early as possible (within the first 8 weeks) following",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        449.83502197265625,
        464.72137451171875,
        461.6520080566406
      ],
      "text": "initiation of antituberculosis treatment  (strong recommendation, very low-certainty evidence)  (16, 21).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        473.3951110839844,
        515.7061157226562,
        485.21209716796875
      ],
      "text": "30.\tRoutine co-trimoxazole prophylaxis should be given to all people living with HIV with active TB disease regardless",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        483.10760498046875,
        360.781982421875,
        494.9245910644531
      ],
      "text": "of CD4 cell count  (strong recommendation, high-certainty evidence)  (21).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        505.30633544921875,
        306.4153747558594,
        518.496337890625
      ],
      "text": "Integrated delivery of care for HIV-associated TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
